const html = "<p>Absence Management in Oracle Fusion HCM handles leave policies, accrual calculations, and absence tracking for your organization.</p>\n<h2 id=\"absence-architecture\">Absence Architecture</h2>\n<p>Key components of absence management:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Leave types: Paid time off, sick leave, etc.</li>\n<li>Accrual policies: How leave is earned</li>\n<li>Carryover rules: Unused leave handling</li>\n<li>Absence requests: Employee leave submission</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"leave-types\">Leave Types</h2>\n<p>Define leave categories for your organization:</p>\n<h3 id=\"statutory-leave\">Statutory Leave</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Vacation: Paid time off</li>\n<li>Sick Leave: Illness-related absence</li>\n<li>Bereavement: Death-related leave</li>\n<li>Parental: Birth or adoption leave</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"administrative-leave\">Administrative Leave</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Training: Professional development</li>\n<li>Jury Duty: Legal obligation</li>\n<li>Military Service: Military reserve</li>\n<li>Unpaid Leave: Without compensation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"accrual-policies\">Accrual Policies</h2>\n<p>Define how leave is earned:</p>\n<h3 id=\"accrual-methods\">Accrual Methods</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Service-based: Increases with years</li>\n<li>Fixed: Same amount for all</li>\n<li>Fixed Anniversary: Resets each anniversary</li>\n<li>Scheduled: Varies by date</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"accrual-calculation\">Accrual Calculation</h3>\n<p>Accruals run automatically:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Monthly: Accrue each month</li>\n<li>Quarterly: Accrue each quarter</li>\n<li>Annually: Accrue each anniversary</li>\n<li>As-needed: Manual accrual</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"carryover-rules\">Carryover Rules</h2>\n<p>Manage unused leave:</p>\n<h3 id=\"carryover-policies\">Carryover Policies</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No carryover: Lose unused balance</li>\n<li>Limited carryover: Maximum carry forward</li>\n<li>Full carryover: Carry all unused</li>\n<li>Decay: Reduce carryover over time</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"request-management\">Request Management</h2>\n<p>Employee leave request workflow:</p>\n<h3 id=\"request-process\">Request Process</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Submission</strong>: Employee submits request</li>\n<li><strong>Validation</strong>: System checks availability</li>\n<li><strong>Approval</strong>: Manager reviews and approves</li>\n<li><strong>Deduction</strong>: Balance automatically adjusted</li>\n<li><strong>Payroll</strong>: Marked in payroll system</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"approval-rules\">Approval Rules</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Manager approval required</li>\n<li>Multiple approval levels</li>\n<li>Auto-approval for eligible requests</li>\n<li>Exception handling for edge cases</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"entitlements\">Entitlements</h2>\n<p>Manage employee leave entitlements:</p>\n<h3 id=\"entitlement-components\">Entitlement Components</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Base entitlement: Standard allocation</li>\n<li>Adjustments: Special grants or corrections</li>\n<li>Carryover: From previous period</li>\n<li>Current balance: Available for use</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"absence-reporting\">Absence Reporting</h2>\n<p>Track and report on absence:</p>\n<h3 id=\"reports-generated\">Reports Generated</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Absence Summary: Total by employee</li>\n<li>Leave Balance: Current available</li>\n<li>Absence Trends: Historical patterns</li>\n<li>Audit Trail: Change history</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"compliance-considerations\">Compliance Considerations</h2>\n<p>Ensure regulatory compliance:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Statutory minimums: Meet legal requirements</li>\n<li>Portability: Correct state regulations</li>\n<li>Disclosure: Proper accounting treatment</li>\n<li>Records: Maintain audit trail</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"integration-with-payroll\">Integration with Payroll</h2>\n<p>Absence data affects payroll:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hours adjustment: Time not worked</li>\n<li>Earnings calculation: Leave paid as earnings</li>\n<li>Deduction: Balance reduction</li>\n<li>Accrual: Ongoing tracking</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"multi-country-considerations\">Multi-Country Considerations</h2>\n<p>Managing global leave requirements:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Country-specific rules</li>\n<li>Local statutory minimums</li>\n<li>Currency and payment treatment</li>\n<li>Reporting requirements</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"best-practices\">Best Practices</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Establish clear policies</strong> documented for employees</li>\n<li><strong>Configure policies</strong> matching legal requirements</li>\n<li><strong>Test accruals</strong> thoroughly before go-live</li>\n<li><strong>Communicate changes</strong> to affected employees</li>\n<li><strong>Monitor usage</strong> for patterns and issues</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"conclusion\">Conclusion</h2>\n<p>Proper absence management ensures fair treatment, legal compliance, and accurate payroll processing. Invest in thorough policy definition and system configuration.</p>";

				const frontmatter = {"title":"Absence Management: Configure Leave Policies and Accruals","description":"Setup and manage leave policies, accruals, and absence tracking in Oracle Fusion HCM","pubDate":"2026-08-13T00:00:00.000Z","category":"Functional","tags":["Absence Management","Leave","Functional","Policies"],"readTime":12};
